WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:01.986
-[Caine]: Need some time to relax?

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:04.016
Well, today is your special day,

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:07.785
because we're going to
the Digital Circus Tropical getaway...

00:00:07.809 --> 00:00:09.096
Resort.

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:11.926
This trip is just wild --
unlike anything else --

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:15.406
because you get special gifts
all to yourself!

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:17.216
-[Pomni]: Oh, God, what now?
-[Caine]: Relax!

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:18.736
Everything is going to be fine.

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:21.796
Bur first, let me introduce you
to these seven Pomnis!

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:23.391
Oh, my.
-[Pomni]: What?

00:00:23.415 --> 00:00:25.286
-[Pomni Pendant 1]:
Time for some good ol' sunshine!

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:26.505
-[Pomni Pendant 2]:
[maniacal laughter]

00:00:26.529 --> 00:00:28.116
[BOINK!] you!
[SPLAT!] you, [BONK!]

00:00:28.141 --> 00:00:30.341
-[Pomni Pendant 3]: I feel like a leaf...
-[Pomni Pendant 4]: I need a drink.

00:00:30.366 --> 00:00:32.436
-[Pomni Pendant 5]: Hey, guys.
I'm just normal Pomni.

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:35.916
-[Pomni Pendant 6]: [villainous laughter]
[SPLAT!] you, [CRASH!] -- again!

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:37.327
-[Caine]: New and so charming!

00:00:37.351 --> 00:00:39.126
Five common, one rare!

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:42.236
And an extra one
that is super, uh, rare.

00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:45.116
Random they come,
seven Pomnai to collect,

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:47.916
but six you see
as you inspect.

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:49.666
For, SHHH!!
Keep your voice down.

00:00:49.690 --> 00:00:51.086
Please speak calmly.

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:55.366
For we d-d-don't t-t-talk
about THAT rare Pomni.

00:00:55.390 --> 00:00:56.982
-[Pomni Pendant 7]:
Iconic catch phrase!

00:00:57.006 --> 00:00:59.740
-[Pomni]: Are you going to be
rhyming for this whole thing?

00:01:00.769 --> 00:01:01.769
-[Caine]: [flatly]
Yeah.

00:01:02.326 --> 00:01:04.079
[whimsical]
Now, relax and sit back!

00:01:04.104 --> 00:01:05.509
Patience is key!

00:01:05.533 --> 00:01:07.746
And let's see what's behind
Curtain Number Th--

00:01:07.771 --> 00:01:09.086
[stammers dispiritedly]
Yeah.

00:01:10.384 --> 00:01:12.251
-[Pomni Pendant 1]: [yelps]
Why is he so heavy?

00:01:12.276 --> 00:01:13.117
-[Pomni Pendant 6]:
Fat [CRASH]!

00:01:13.142 --> 00:01:14.191
-[Jax]: [slurred, muffled]

00:01:15.771 --> 00:01:16.476
-[Caine]: Tabarnak!

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:18.496
We can't have another death
at the resort!

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:20.202
Somebody do something!
Call a doctor!

00:01:20.226 --> 00:01:21.216
-[Jax]: AAAAUUUGGHH--

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:23.730
-[Caine]: Or, yeah --
just do that, I guess.

00:01:23.754 --> 00:01:25.986
Whatever.
-[Pomni]: Eh!

00:01:26.010 --> 00:01:27.976
Who are those guys?

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:29.766
-[Caine]: Oh, those are
just resort guests.

00:01:29.790 --> 00:01:30.770
Just ignore them, okay?

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:33.086
-[Ragatha Animiniz]:
This resort's just incredible!

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:35.696
I've never been so relaxed
in my whole life.

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:38.046
-[Zooble Animiniz]: Yeah.
Honestly, I gotta give it to Caine.

00:01:38.070 --> 00:01:39.816
He's really outdone
himself with this.

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:42.820
-[Caine]: Hey, will you
shut the ffffffrick up?!

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:45.585
Uh-oh, it's Prize Number 2 time,

00:01:45.610 --> 00:01:47.145
and what could it be?

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:49.546
Why, it's a funny,
squishy Kinger!

00:01:49.570 --> 00:01:51.746
Hahaha, heeheehee!

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:52.506
-[Kinger]: [deep voice]
Hey, guys!

00:01:52.530 --> 00:01:55.346
-[Pomni]: Why have all of these prizes
just been strange,

00:01:55.370 --> 00:01:57.126
deformed versions of us?

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:59.357
It's a bit uncomfortable.

00:01:59.382 --> 00:02:01.653
-[Caine]: Oh, uh --
Well -- Hmm.

00:02:01.677 --> 00:02:03.836
[clicks tongue]
Would this make things better?

00:02:03.860 --> 00:02:04.586
-[Kinger]: AAAAAAAAAAAAUUGHHH--

00:02:04.610 --> 00:02:06.366
-[Pomni]: W-Why do you keep doing this?!

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:07.926
-[Pomni Animiniz]:
What's with all the negativity?

00:02:07.950 --> 00:02:09.746
These prizes are incredible!

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:11.160
-[Kinger Animiniz]:
God, I wish that was me.

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:12.620
-[Caine]: Just shut the frig up!!

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:14.750
You no-talent,
mediocre piece--

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:17.816
For the first time ever,
we'll throw in this T--

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:19.350
-[Model]: Hey, guys.

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:21.057
-[Caine]: We'll throw in this, too!

00:02:21.081 --> 00:02:24.310
A delightful little T-shirt
that'll be perfect for you!

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:26.066
-[Pomni]: Wait,
we've done T-shirts before --

00:02:26.090 --> 00:02:28.030
[muffled scream]
-[Caine]: For the first time ever...

00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:28.950
agai--
[chaos]

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:32.036
Turn your room into a museum
where anything goes

00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:35.586
with these amazing prints
that will curl your toes!

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:38.464
-[Gangle Animiniz]:
Wow, this art looks so nice and pretty!

00:02:38.488 --> 00:02:41.886
Made from artists with such
incredible talent and skill.

00:02:41.910 --> 00:02:43.166
-[Caine]: [shrilly]
SHUT UP!!!!

00:02:43.190 --> 00:02:45.810
Wha -- Are you kidding me?!

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:47.830
I'm in a meeting!!!!

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:49.252
Shut up!!!!

00:02:49.793 --> 00:02:50.725
-[Pomni]: [weak exclamation]

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:52.230
-[Jax Animiniz]:
Boy, I could definitely use

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:54.046
one of those shirts
right about now.

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:55.596
Too bad we were
excluded from --

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:57.296
-[Caine]: SHUT --
Actually, wait a minute.

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:58.805
That gives me an idea!

00:02:59.488 --> 00:03:01.350
Get in there, you freaks!

00:03:01.375 --> 00:03:02.436
You, too!

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:05.020
-[Pomni]: [muffled]
I can't breathe!

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:07.236
-[Caine]: Wanna start your
tropical getaway today?

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:10.146
Then travel on over
to digitalcircus.store.

00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:12.856
And now, until
the 27th of December,

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:14.975
you can save up to 30% off

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:17.186
on merch items store-wide!

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:19.466
Wowzers!
[sirens wailing]

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:20.711
Oh, no -- it's the 5-0!

00:03:20.736 --> 00:03:22.360
They know about
the illegal shrimp show!

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:24.456
-[Officer]: We have the whole
place surrounded!

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:27.250
Come out with your hands up,
or you'll be grounded!

00:03:27.275 --> 00:03:28.680
-[Caine]: Gotta go!
Be sure to remember --

00:03:28.710 --> 00:03:31.143
this sale is only on
till the 27th of December!

00:03:31.168 --> 00:03:32.600
[pounding on door]
Toodle-oo!

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:36.706
So, honest opinions, guys.
Whatcha think?

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:38.180
-[Fish 1]: [speaking Spanish throughout]

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:44.840
-[Fish 2]: Where's the
continental breakfast?

00:03:54.820 --> 00:03:56.450
-[Fish 2]: Rhyming like a fool.

00:04:03.366 --> 00:04:05.190
[muffled speech continues]

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:06.990
-[Caine]: [sighs]
This isn't fun anymore.

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:08.740
[both shrieking]

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:10.740
[festive music plays]

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:16.250
♪♪

